{"id": "EUVD-2026-104279", "enisaUuid": "d599005b-7773-3eb2-9195-fe8409f029e6", "description": "FlyCms through commit edfdf724 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in ActionService.counter() that allows authenticated users to modify other users' content rows because checkRowOwner never verifies ownership. Any registered user can send requests to /ucenter/action/{modelCode}/{id}/counter or /ucenter/action/compose to add arbitrary deltas to numeric fields like price, stock, or points.", "datePublished": "2026-10-19T13:55:35", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T17:51:42", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/sunkaifei/FlyCms/issues/19", "https://github.com/sunkaifei/FlyCms/blob/edfdf724c3b944310f60c29aa755d03a00a75837/backend/src/main/java/com/flycms/module/model/service/ActionService.java", "https://github.com/sunkaifei/FlyCms/blob/edfdf724c3b944310f60c29aa755d03a00a75837/backend/src/main/java/com/flycms/web/front/ActionController.java", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/flycms-through-commit-edfdf724-missing-authorization-via-action-counter-endpoint"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-112294", "GHSA-v455-8jmh-chm4"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "82861b16-9774-3682-96c2-8ccc15f24ae7", "product": {"name": "FlyCMS", "vendor": {"name": "sunkaifei"}}, "product_version": "0 \u2264edfdf724c3b944310f60c29aa755d03a00a75837"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "e8a7c69a-2019-35e9-a093-36e65d9b4ffe", "vendor": {"name": "sunkaifei"}}], "isExploited": false}